                "content": "<h1>Welcome to your Blank Canvas</h1><p>This is a flexible, document-style portfolio template designed for creators who want complete control over their narrative.</p><br><h3>How to use this template:</h3><ul><li><strong>Just start typing:</strong> Click anywhere and start writing your story.</li><li><strong>Add rich content:</strong> Type <code>/</code> to open the command menu. You can add headings, lists, images, code blocks, and more.</li><li><strong>Customize the look:</strong> Use the \"Visual Editor\" button to change the font, max-width, and other settings.</li></ul><br><h3>What can you build?</h3><p>This template is perfect for:</p><ul><li>Case studies and long-form writing</li><li>Minimalist resumes</li><li>Project documentation</li><li>Personal blogs</li></ul><br><p><em>Delete this text and start creating your masterpiece!</em></p>"
